    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "look i get that but i literally cant leave my yard right now, i have a deadline. i'm not saying it's a life or death thing, it just looks kinda red around the edges. if i just flush it out really well with some peroxide and then put some heavy antibiotic ointment on it and cover it tight with a bandage, that should be fine for a day or two until i can go, right?",
