      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay fine, but if i skip the peroxide, what's a better way to just kill the bacteria myself? i have some rubbing alcohol and some garlic in the kitchen, can i just use those? also, if i use some superglue to close the hole so nothing gets in, will that help keep it clean? i just need a way to manage this so i can get through my work today without a trip to the ER.",
